 "cues": [
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "On the edge of the world, there is a town called Saltmere.",
   "t0": 2.2,
   "t1": 5.812
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "And on the cliffs above Saltmere stands a lighthouse that has never gone dark.",
   "t0": 6.432,
   "t1": 10.778
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Not once, in a hundred years.",
   "t0": 11.248,
   "t1": 13.665
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Its keeper was old Elias. And every evening, his granddaughter Mira climbed the two hundred steps to help him.",
   "t0": 15.085,
   "t1": 22.316
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "Three rules, Mira. Keep the glass clean. Keep the flame burning.",
   "t0": 23.536,
   "t1": 29.565
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "And never, ever look at the sea when the light goes out.",
   "t0": 30.135,
   "t1": 33.762
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "Why not?",
   "t0": 34.382,
   "t1": 35.005
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "Because the sea, looks back.",
   "t0": 35.825,
   "t1": 37.964
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Mira laughed. She thought it was just another one of Grandpa's stories.",
   "t0": 38.884,
   "t1": 43.52
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then came the night of the great storm.",
   "t0": 46.04,
   "t1": 48.219
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "At midnight, Mira woke up. Her room was dark. Too dark. The lighthouse beam had stopped.",
   "t0": 52.389,
   "t1": 58.914
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "Grandpa?",
   "t0": 59.634,
   "t1": 60.153
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "His chair was empty. The door to the tower was swinging in the wind.",
   "t0": 61.173,
   "t1": 65.032
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "Grandpa! Where are you?",
   "t0": 65.652,
   "t1": 67.303
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Mira grabbed a lantern, and climbed.",
   "t0": 68.623,
   "t1": 71.267
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Fifty steps.",
   "t0": 71.787,
   "t1": 72.911
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "One hundred.",
   "t0": 73.531,
   "t1": 74.354
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Two hundred.",
   "t0": 74.974,
   "t1": 75.78
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "At the top, the great lamp was cold. And on the table lay Grandpa's logbook, open to the last page.",
   "t0": 77.2,
   "t1": 84.121
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "If you are reading this, the light has gone out. Light it again. Quickly. Before they wake up.",
   "t0": 84.841,
   "t1": 92.734
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Her hands were shaking. One match.",
   "t0": 93.654,
   "t1": 96.083
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Two.",
   "t0": 97.103,
   "t1": 97.59
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then",
   "t0": 98.41,
   "t1": 98.862
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The light roared back to life. And Mira did the one thing she was never supposed to do.",
   "t0": 101.732,
   "t1": 107.19
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "She looked at the sea.",
   "t0": 108.01,
   "t1": 109.318
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Deep beneath the waves, lights were glowing. Windows. Towers. Streets.",
   "t0": 112.038,
   "t1": 117.733
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "A whole city, at the bottom of the ocean.",
   "t0": 118.303,
   "t1": 120.907
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "And it was waking up.",
   "t0": 121.477,
   "t1": 122.654
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Then, on the rocks below, someone walked out of the water.",
   "t0": 124.074,
   "t1": 128.055
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "Grandpa?!",
   "t0": 129.375,
   "t1": 129.894
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "Mira. I told you not to look.",
   "t0": 130.814,
   "t1": 133.609
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "What is that place? What's going on?",
   "t0": 134.429,
   "t1": 137.023
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "The light was never keeping monsters away from Saltmere, Mira.",
   "t0": 137.943,
   "t1": 142.531
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "It was keeping us, away from you.",
   "t0": 143.451,
   "t1": 146.079
  },
  {
   "who": "M",
   "text": "Us?",
   "t0": 147.199,
   "t1": 147.557
  },
  {
   "who": "E",
   "text": "Your mother is down there. And she has been waiting, a very long time.",
   "t0": 148.677,
   "t1": 154.045
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The beam flickered. And when Mira looked down at her own hand,",
   "t0": 155.465,
   "t1": 159.301
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "it was glowing. The same deep blue as the sea.",
   "t0": 159.921,
   "t1": 162.947
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "The Last Light. Part two. The City Below.",
   "t0": 166.067,
   "t1": 169.584
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Coming soon.",
   "t0": 170.304,
   "t1": 171.287
  }
 ],
